This product includes software developed for the AI Human Oversight
Hackathon (Deloitte x Enel FNC, 2026), based on the EnerGuard Starter Kit
provided by the hackathon organisers.

The dataset (energuard_dataset.csv, energuard_dataset_EXCEL.csv,
energuard_dataset.xlsx) is synthetic and contains no personal or
production data.

